ith all the colorful clients the city has to offer – from officials to entrepreneurs. Help four different quest-givers to fulfill their ambitious automotive shelving needs in various unique scenarios to be crowned the king of Parking World!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Parking Worlds Highlights! </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and time system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced NPC &amp; Vehicle Behaviors   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Rating System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water &amp; Electricity Management </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Events </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeplay Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Narrative Scenarios  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Build, manage, and expand your own lucrative parking enterprise in this management sim. Parking World puts the power to build your perfect parking garage at your fingertips while solving everybody else's parking problems in unique narrative scenarios or without any objectives in freeplay mode.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551570/04354721a327fe1e84f14593991d5f1540def9be/header.jpg?t=1758031228", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551570/a762b48a018df5a99096fc4e9aa8dd78f76079fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758031228", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551570/a762b48a018df5a99096fc4e9aa8dd78f76079fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758031228", "website": "https://www.parkingworld.de", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syste